From 4c8dc2db183242700b06d0f3090f80f37539752d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Tan <2604749@sit.singaporetech.edu.sg>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:45:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Web app: grants home page behind the logo

Clicking the logo now opens a home page instead of redirecting to the login or
history page. It lists the four grants the auditor decides on (EEG Advanced
Tier, EEG Base Tier, ESP, SRG) with their co-funding rate, cap and conditions,
and who can apply. The figures come from the GrantScheme classes, SmeCriteria
and the thresholds currently saved by an admin, so the page always matches the
rules the Logic Manager applies. Visitors are invited to log in; logged-in
users get 'Start a new audit'.

test_index_redirects_to_login becomes test_index_is_the_grants_home_page;
new tests in tests/test_web_home.py.
