+        f"{config.minimum_impact_pct:g}% they are not funded.",
+        "Equipment subsidies are never more than the retrofit cost you enter.",
+        f"Companies that are not SMEs are pointed to the {EFS_GREEN_NAME} instead.",
+    ]
